msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, it's Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh hey, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, hola, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why didn't you come over for＿breakfast? I had it ready and＿everything.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué no viniste a desayunar?＿Ya lo tenía listo y todo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Like I told you last time, I'm gonna do＿whatever I want.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como te dije la última vez,＿haré lo que me dé la gana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Try walking in my shoes and see how＿used YOU feel.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ponte en mi lugar a ver qué tan＿utilizado te sientes TÚ.）」"

msgid "Taiga「Say, are you going shopping?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, ¿vas a hacer las compras?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. You know me too well.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Me conoces demasiado bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「Those reusable bags are a dead＿giveaway. Buying ingredients for＿lunch?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esas bolsas reutilizables te＿delatan. ¿Vas a comprar ingredientes＿para el almuerzo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Pretty much. I was thinking of going＿all-out today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Más o menos. Hoy pensaba lucirme.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Just make fried rice.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Solo haz arroz frito.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fried rice?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Arroz frito?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah. I wanna have fried rice for lunch.＿Cool with that?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Quiero comer arroz frito para＿el almuerzo. ¿Te parece bien?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure, but didn't you just have it the＿other day? And besides, wouldn't you＿rather have something fancy today?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro, ¿pero no comiste eso el＿otro día? Además, ¿no preferirías＿algo especial hoy?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine. Fried rice is good.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está bien. El arroz frito está bueno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Okay, I'll go get the ingredients we＿need, so you had better show up for＿lunch.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bien, iré a comprar lo＿que necesitamos, así que más＿te vale venir a almorzar.」"

msgid "Taiga「Alright.」"
msgstr "Taiga「De acuerdo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fried rice, huh? Can I make it fancier＿somehow? Nah, I'm better off making＿dessert......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Arroz frito, ¿eh? ¿Podré hacerlo＿más especial de algún modo? No, mejor＿preparo un postre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Lunch is ready. It's fried rice, at Taiga's＿request.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El almuerzo está listo. Es arroz＿frito, a petición de Taiga.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yaaay! Yacchan loooves Ryuu-chan's＿fried rice～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Yuuupi! ¡A Yacchan le encaaanta＿el arroz frito de Ryuu-chan～①」"

msgid "Taiga「......Thanks for the food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Gracias por la comida.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Thanks for the food～!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Gracias por la comida～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Eat up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Buen provecho.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Mmm～ So tastyyy! Isn't it, Taiga-chan?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mmm～ ¡Qué ricooo! ¿Verdad, Taiga-chan?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Anything Ryuu-chan cooks is yummy,＿but when Taiga-chan is here, it tastes＿even better～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Todo lo que cocina Ryuu-chan＿es rico, pero cuando está Taiga-chan＿sabe aún mejor～」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan............」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan............」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ehehe～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ejeje～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga, there's still plenty if you want＿seconds.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga, todavía queda bastante＿si quieres repetir.」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're sure taking your time eating＿today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hoy te estás tomando＿tu tiempo para comer.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Normally you wolf everything down＿and shout \"Seconds!\"」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Normalmente devoras todo＿y gritas \"¡Quiero más!\"」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't I get to decide how fast to eat my＿own food?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No puedo decidir qué tan rápido＿comerme mi propia comida?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, yeah, you do.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, sí, claro.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm savoring it, because your fried＿rice...... is delicious.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Lo estoy saboreando, porque tu arroz＿frito...... está delicioso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ya veo.」"

msgid "Taiga「When you eat delicious food every day＿it doesn't seem so special, but it really＿is.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cuando comes comida deliciosa＿todos los días no parece gran＿cosa, pero sí que lo es.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Besides, when you don't appreciate it,＿it's such a huge waste, I think.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Además, cuando no lo valoras, me＿parece un desperdicio enorme.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm glad I noticed.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me alegro de haberme dado cuenta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's this all of a sudden? I can＿make fried rice any old time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Y esto a qué viene? Puedo＿hacer arroz frito cuando sea.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. I went all-out and made almond＿jelly for dessert today.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Hoy me lucí e hice gelatina＿de almendras de postre.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yaaay! Taiga-chan, do you like almond＿jelly?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Yuuupi! Taiga-chan, ¿te gusta＿la gelatina de almendras?」"

msgid "Taiga「I do.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's great～ With all this yummy＿food, you should keep eating with us.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Qué bien～ Con toda esta comida rica,＿deberías seguir comiendo con nosotros.」"

msgid "Taiga「............Seconds.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Quiero más.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Do your best at the test of courage＿today.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esfuérzate en la prueba de valor de hoy.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You mean, with Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Te refieres a lo de Kushieda?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yep. I'm betting everything on tonight.＿I'll be supporting you completely to＿make sure you don't screw up.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Me lo juego todo esta noche.＿Te apoyaré por completo para＿que no la arruines.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga......?」"

msgid "Taiga「So, that's that. See you tonight.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que eso es todo. Nos＿vemos esta noche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Something's off. I don't know what it＿is, but I know it's not right.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Algo anda mal. No sé qué＿es, pero sé que no está bien.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga seems to be trying to confirm＿something...... There's something she's＿not telling me......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Parece que Taiga intenta confirmar＿algo...... Hay algo que no me＿está diciendo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Just what is she up to......? Should I go＿after her and ask?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué se trae entre manos......?＿¿Debería ir tras ella y preguntarle?）」"

msgid "Go after her, NOW"
msgstr "Ir tras ella, AHORA"

msgid "No, I should tidy up first"
msgstr "No, primero debo recoger"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Yeah, I definitely gotta go after her.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Sí, sin duda tengo＿que ir tras ella.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Hang on. Slow and steady wins the＿race. I gotta make tidying up the＿priority here.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Espera. Sin prisa pero＿sin pausa. Aquí lo prioritario＿es recoger todo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Pero qué?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......It's a lunchbox. This...... isn't one of＿ours. Somehow I know that for a fact.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Es una caja de almuerzo.＿Esta...... no es nuestra. De algún＿modo lo sé con certeza.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Then whose is it? It feels familiar,＿but......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Entonces de quién es? Me resulta＿familiar, pero......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......It's no use. I can't remember. But＿why would a lunchbox that isn't ours＿be here in the first place?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Es inútil. No puedo recordar.＿¿Pero por qué habría aquí una caja de＿almuerzo que no es nuestra?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Taiga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Did Taiga leave it here......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿La dejó aquí Taiga......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What's the meaning of all this? I should＿definitely go after her and get to the＿bottom of this.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué significa todo esto? Sin＿duda debería ir tras ella y llegar＿al fondo del asunto.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（For now, I'll be keeping this lunchbox.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por ahora, me quedaré con＿esta caja de almuerzo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hm......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Mm......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（An empty can, huh. If you're going to＿leave it, at least try to leave it near the＿wastebasket......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una lata vacía, eh. Si la vas＿a dejar tirada, al menos déjala＿cerca del basurero......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......*Sigh* I'll throw it away.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......*Suspiro* La tiraré.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No encontré nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Whew. Cleanup is done.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Uf. Limpieza terminada.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Alright, time to find Taiga.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Bien, hora de buscar a Taiga.）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Taiga-chan, Ryuu-chan can make so＿many other things that are even＿tastier than fried rice～ Right?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Taiga-chan, Ryuu-chan sabe hacer＿muchas otras cosas aún más ricas＿que el arroz frito～ ¿Verdad?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan～①」"

msgid "Taiga「Despite what you said yesterday, I＿really do think that if you spend some＿time with her, you'll find your feelings.」"
msgstr "Taiga「A pesar de lo que dijiste ayer, creo＿de verdad que si pasas tiempo con ella,＿encontrarás tus sentimientos.」"

msgid "Taiga「With or without your memories.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Con o sin tus recuerdos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Besides, with the right opportunities,＿your memories will return. You just＿haven't had any, that's all. But tonight」"
msgstr "Taiga「Además, con la oportunidad adecuada, tus＿recuerdos volverán. Solo te ha faltado＿una, eso es todo. Pero esta noche」"

msgid "Taiga「will be different.」"
msgstr "Taiga「será diferente.」"
